/*! \page code_lattice Lattice structures
\brief Enumerates functionalities of qmc::Lattice and possible user-made
expansions.

All physical considerations about the studied systems are found in the
qmc::Lattice class. This includes operator definitions (types, signs, propagation
effects on spins, etc...), selection procedures for operator loop updates,
providing allowed spin types, etc...

This thus results in the most massive class of the code, provided the rest of
the algorithm must follow a structure as general as possible.
*/

